> * The minimum value is 20.', example='20'),
  retention?: int32(name='Retention', description='The retention period of the user backup file. Unit: days. The value must be an integer greater than **0**.', example='30'),
  sourceInfo?: string(name='SourceInfo', description='A JSON array that provides the source information for the full backup (case-sensitive). Example:

```
{"sourceIp":"172.20.xx
.xx","sourcePort":"9999"}

```

