- **PL1 ESSD cloud disk**: 20 GB to 3200 GB
- **PL2 ESSD cloud disk**: 500 GB to 3200 GB
- **PL3 ESSD cloud disk**: 1500 GB to 3200 GB
- **Premium performance disk**: 40 GB to 2000 GB

